    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/700ef46dc60649ab222358844ef635d3.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/700ef46dc60649ab222358844ef635d3.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/700ef46dc60649ab222358844ef635d3.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls: old school movement of the tightest kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/02c203c47f97d3578835c26c888e1863.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/02c203c47f97d3578835c26c888e1863.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/02c203c47f97d3578835c26c888e1863.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shhhh, don't tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/1808d3e031731f278ded1411361ccc38.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/1808d3e031731f278ded1411361ccc38.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/1808d3e031731f278ded1411361ccc38.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy ammo swapping mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/68a7b2f38b0d393d659cfa8a80d125cb.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/68a7b2f38b0d393d659cfa8a80d125cb.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/68a7b2f38b0d393d659cfa8a80d125cb.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's ok, you have limited lives so it will stop eventually!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/36f6ab217b0f353225ce2611ed6a743e.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=638 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/36f6ab217b0f353225ce2611ed6a743e.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/36f6ab217b0f353225ce2611ed6a743e.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls: old school movement of the tightest kind. It's true because I also said it up there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immediate gameplay: no tutorials, no long-winded story about fallen heroes and world-ending catastrophes, just straight to fun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and mouse support, no gamepad required! (though it works quite nicely with a gamepad).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single session play-through: tired of games that never end? This one can be finished in one sitting....maybe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets: they wouldn't be secrets if they weren't hidden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable music: find all of the music notes in each level to unlock new instruments and toggle them on and off to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable artillery: vomit the full spectrum of the rainbow and then some.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant respawn for maximum <span class=\"bb_strike\">frustration</span> fun.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/700ef46dc60649ab222358844ef635d3.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/700ef46dc60649ab222358844ef635d3.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/700ef46dc60649ab222358844ef635d3.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls: old school movement of the tightest kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/02c203c47f97d3578835c26c888e1863.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/02c203c47f97d3578835c26c888e1863.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/02c203c47f97d3578835c26c888e1863.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shhhh, don't tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/1808d3e031731f278ded1411361ccc38.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/1808d3e031731f278ded1411361ccc38.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/1808d3e031731f278ded1411361ccc38.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy ammo swapping mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/68a7b2f38b0d393d659cfa8a80d125cb.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/68a7b2f38b0d393d659cfa8a80d125cb.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/68a7b2f38b0d393d659cfa8a80d125cb.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's ok, you have limited lives so it will stop eventually!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/36f6ab217b0f353225ce2611ed6a743e.poster.avif?t=1752767354\" width=638 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/36f6ab217b0f353225ce2611ed6a743e.webm?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449070/extras/36f6ab217b0f353225ce2611ed6a743e.mp4?t=1752767354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls: old school movement of the tightest kind. It's true because I also said it up there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immediate gameplay: no tutorials, no long-winded story about fallen heroes and world-ending catastrophes, just straight to fun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and mouse support, no gamepad required! (though it works quite nicely with a gamepad).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single session play-through: tired of games that never end? This one can be finished in one sitting....maybe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets: they wouldn't be secrets if they weren't hidden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable music: find all of the music notes in each level to unlock new instruments and toggle them on and off to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable artillery: vomit the full spectrum of the rainbow and then some.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant respawn for maximum <span class=\"bb_strike\">frustration</span> fun.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Square off against evil rhombi in this microvania platforming shmup. Find secrets passageways, unlock new weapons, dodge waves of enemies all in search of your beloved pet bot. Jump, barf, die, repeat.",
